Brown Sugar Muffins

1 1/2 c flour
1/4 c granulated sugar
1/4 tsp salt
1/2 tsp cinnamon
3 1/2 tsp baking powder
1/4 c light brown sugar
1 egg, lighly beaten
1/2 c oil
1/2 c milk
preheat oven to 400F
sift together flour, granulated sugar, salt, cinnamon, and baking powder.  stir in the brown sugar
combine the egg, oil, and milk and stir into dry ingredients just enough to moisten.  fill greased muffin tins 2/3 full and bake 20-25 min or until done
makes about 18 muffins

